--- title
# Eviz

--- body
SaaS for digital business cards, landing pages, lead capture and CRM.

--- actions
[Product](https://www.eviz.me/) · [Portfolio](/en/#products)
:::

::: section architecture
## Architecture

Eviz connects public business pages to account management and customer relationship workflows.

- **Page publishing:** digital cards, landing pages and configurable content.
- **Public interactions:** forms and contact channels associated with published pages.
- **CRM:** lead and contact records, commercial activities and related workflows.
- **Application services:** identity, accounts, publishing, forms, business records and billing.
- **Persistence:** relational data accessed through the backend.

The public pages and the authenticated management interface use the same application domains through distinct web experiences.
:::

::: section technologies
## Technologies

- **Frontend:** React, TypeScript, Vite, TipTap.
- **Backend:** NestJS, TypeScript, REST APIs.
- **Data:** Prisma, PostgreSQL.
- **Real-time features:** Socket.IO.
- **Payments:** Stripe and Asaas integrations.
:::

